{"Components":{"Name":{"Name":"CreditsText"},"Transform":{"Rotation":[0,0,0,1],"Scale":[1,1,1],"Translation":[0,0,0]},"UIRect":{"AnchorMax":[0.5,0],"AnchorMin":[0.5,0],"FitContent":"None","IgnoreLayout":false,"Pivot":[0.5,0],"Position":[0,80],"Size":[540,900]},"UIText":{"Alignment":"Center","Color":[0.95,0.96,1,1],"Font":"D6EE8E4B447D87B4","FontSize":22,"LineSpacing":1,"OutlineColor":[0,0,0,1],"OutlineWidth":0,"Overflow":"Overflow","RaycastTarget":false,"Text":"SKY ISLANDS\n\nA Strata sample project, made through the editor by an AI agent.\n\nROBOT\nRobotExpressive by Tomas Laulhe (Quaternius), modified by Don McCurdy (CC0)\n\nCOURSE\nPlatformer Kit by Kenney (CC0)\n\nSKY\nKloofendal 48d Partly Cloudy (Pure Sky) by Greg Zaal and Jarod Guest, Poly Haven (CC0)\n\nSOUNDS\nImpact Sounds, Interface Sounds and UI Pack by Kenney (CC0)\n\nFONT\nKenney Future by Kenney (CC0)\n\nENGINE\nStrata: rendering through NVRHI on Vulkan, physics, animation, audio, game UI and C++ scripts\n\nThanks for playing!","VerticalAlignment":"Middle","Wrap":true}},"ID":"BBEE4081F8AE7866","Parent":"77F86C96D39CBEF3"},
